44
00:01:50,185 --> 00:01:56,245
the documentation or in the
book about how to debug.

45
00:01:56,245 --> 00:01:57,970
User mode Linux is no

46
00:01:57,970 --> 00:01:59,470
longer really
maintained and updated,

47
00:01:59,470 --> 00:02:01,765
that one's not really
an option anymore.

48
00:02:01,765 --> 00:02:04,050
Linux Trace Toolkit
is pretty useful,

49
00:02:04,050 --> 00:02:05,635
you can use it to trace

50
00:02:05,635 --> 00:02:08,450
